      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once more you enter the bazaar of the merchant. Some of the loot that
    you not-so-carefully laid out during your last visit seems to still rest on the
    counter between you.



    Once more you barter for a piece of armor. This time
    however you gravitate to the most outstanding (or rather outlandish) piece of
    gear you can find a gigantic breast plate! At least two sizes are too large for
    you.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5302535af1044152a457ed104f1f4b91, type: 2}
