  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You smugly sit in the corner of the inn, with your sleeves rolled up.
    The shimmering gauntlets are on display for all to see.

    To your surprise
    however, no one seems to perceive your new gauntlets. To be frank, no one seemed
    to perceive you in the first place. Baffled by the lack of interaction and affection
    you make the only conclusion that seems plausible; this is not enough armor!

    Merchant
    2

'
